      "sourceHash": "10dc334d888119df06d5e8ef8e140a7f93c8c13587d8427f753b807e4e457321",
      "contextFingerprint": "85816446c84ce17f93ef92ae349a0ae252f6ab0379be8eb67193b13f809e9edd",
      "sourceText": "1. 累计点云中，水平距离不大于 `minDyObsDis=0.3 m` 的点直接给格子增加 `minDyObsPointNum`；不是忽略近点。\n2. 较远的点先满足 `angle1 > minDyObsAngle`，再转到输入位姿对应的雷达自身系；自身仰角在视场窗口内，或 `abs(z_L)<absDyObsRelZThre`，就给格子计数。\n3. 最新一帧裁剪点中，只要该格有满足 `angle1 > minDyObsAngle` 的点，就把计数归零；这一轮没有再次要求视场窗口或0.3 m距离门槛。\n4. 最终计数达到 `minDyObsPointNum=1` 的格子不进入正常地形输出。",
      "translatedText": "1. In the accumulated point cloud, points whose horizontal distance is not greater than `minDyObsDis=0.3 m` directly add `minDyObsPointNum` to the grid; near points are not ignored\\.\n2. Farther points first satisfy `angle1 > minDyObsAngle` and are then transformed into the LiDAR's own frame corresponding to the input pose; if their own elevation angle is within the field\\-of\\-view window, or `abs(z_L)<absDyObsRelZThre`, the grid is counted\\.\n3. In the cropped points of the latest frame, as long as the grid has a point that satisfies `angle1 > minDyObsAngle`, the count is reset to zero; this round no longer requires the field\\-of\\-view window or the 0\\.3 m distance threshold\\.\n4. Grids whose final count reaches `minDyObsPointNum=1` do not enter the normal terrain output\\.",
